{"product_id":"wanna-study-in-the-u-s-101-tips-to-get-you-there","title":"Wanna Study in the U.S.? 101 Tips to Get You There","description":"\u003cp\u003eWanna Study In The U.S.? is the first complete reference available toanyone aspiring to study in the U. S. It provides an invaluable combination ofinsights and information that is not available in any other single source.Whether you are years away from commencing a U. S. degree or weeks away frommailing in your application, you will find tremendous value in this book. TheTop 10 Reasons to Study in the U.S. will help you compare a U.S. education withthat of other countries. The 101 Tips offer detailed, practical advice rangingfrom how to collect American college credits while you are still in school ofediting each line of your essay in order to make the word-limit. ThePoints to Note included with Original Essays of Admitted Applicants show youexactly what works in these essays.  The Student Visa Q\u0026amp; A dispels myths and sheds light on an aspect of major concern for mostapplicants. The book also contains an Application dateline and a list of Resourceson the Web. For the first time in an Indian book is an official interview withStanford University's Associate Director of MBA Admissions.  This book is solid in its substance yet light in itsstyle. It offers a wealth of information that will brighten any applicant'sfuture.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:178 x 229  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Natasha Pratap \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9788129103536 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 319\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44914549555353,"sku":"16RA-3-9788129103536","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/9d60e7472feb3d1af4e9a15cfe4b9a56.jpg?v=1729769146","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/wanna-study-in-the-u-s-101-tips-to-get-you-there","provider":"Dubai - Buy Use